  "id": "social-attachment",
  "term": "social attachment",
  "definition": "Social attachment is a sense of personal connection and belonging that develops between users and a social media platform through ongoing use. In the source, it forms as participation and value co-creation on the platform influence users’ psychological needs and self-expression, supporting continued engagement.",
